sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Citizen as Citizen (Author)
    actor Public as Public / Guest
    actor Staff as Staff HANDLE_COMPLAINT
    participant UI as EcoLink Web UI
    participant RevCtrl as ReviewsController
    participant StfCtrl as StaffComplaintsController
    participant RevSvc as ReviewService
    participant GeoSvc as GeoMatchingService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Citizen,DB: U-10: Cham 1-5 sao don Completed trong 14 ngay -> Tinh AverageRating -> Tu xoa / Kiem duyet

    Citizen->>UI: Chon so sao 1-5 va nhap nhan xet tren Receipt / History
    UI->>RevCtrl: POST /api/v1/handover-requests/{requestId}/reviews
    RevCtrl->>RevSvc: CreateReviewAsync(userId, requestId, dto)
    RevSvc->>DB: Check quyen so huu + Completed + <= 14 ngay + chua tung review (BR-RVW-01)
    alt Don chua Completed hoac qua 14 ngay / da danh gia
        RevSvc-->>RevCtrl: Throw BusinessRuleException (400) hoac ConflictException (409)
        RevCtrl-->>UI: Hien thi loi MSG-RVW-02
    else Hop le
        RevSvc->>DB: INSERT transaction_reviews (Visible) + RECALC recycler_profiles
        RevSvc-->>RevCtrl: 201 Created MSG-RVW-01 + updatedRecyclerAverageRating
        RevCtrl-->>UI: Cap nhat the danh gia & sao trung binh
    end

    Public->>UI: Xem ban do tim vua hoac danh sach doi tac
    UI->>GeoSvc: GET /api/v1/recyclers/{recyclerId} & GET /reviews
    GeoSvc->>DB: Doc average_rating & total_reviews tu recycler_profiles
    RevSvc->>DB: SELECT reviews (chi Visible/Reported) + thong ke 1..5 sao
    GeoSvc-->>UI: 200 OK diem uy tin & phan bo sao

    opt Bao cao vi pham & Staff kiem duyet (BR-RVW-03)
        Public->>RevCtrl: POST /api/v1/reviews/{reviewId}/report (reason >= 5 chars)
        RevSvc->>DB: UPDATE status = Reported, report_count += 1
        Staff->>StfCtrl: PATCH /api/v1/staff/reviews/{reviewId}/moderate (Hide / Restore)
        RevSvc->>DB: UPDATE status = Hidden/Visible + RECALC average_rating + INSERT audit_logs
        StfCtrl-->>Staff: 200 OK MSG-RVW-03
    end

    opt Tac gia tu xoa vinh vien danh gia cua minh (BR-RVW-03)
        Citizen->>RevCtrl: DELETE /api/v1/reviews/{reviewId}
        RevSvc->>DB: Verify ReviewerId == callerId (else 403) -> Deleted + RECALC + AuditLog
        RevCtrl-->>Citizen: 200 OK MSG-RVW-03
    end
